  data: {
    LLM: "Save power cards (2, 10, Joker) for emergencies. Don't play your high Face-Up cards too early unless forced. Clear low cards from hand first.\n\nStacking: If you have three 5s, play them all to force the next player higher.\n\nThe End Game: Memorize what's under your face-up cards if you peeked (cheating? no). Or just know probability. If the pile is a King, don't flip blindly unless you feel lucky.",
